    <oops:hasAffectedElement rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI">There are elements following different naming conventions as for example: http://www.semanticweb.org/franc/ontologies/2023/9/OntologiaLOPDP#where_in_in_the_international_field_you_have_to_have http://www.semanticweb.org/ley-organica-proteccion-datos-personales#Data_Controller</oops:hasAffectedElement>
